},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Magister Umbric says: This may feel a little uncomfortable.",
["id"] = "s8_4076",
["timestamp"] = 1774413472,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Lonelylitten-Stormrage",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Umbric",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Magister Umbric says: We must make haste. Xal'atath is using Alleria's rage and pain to erode her mastery over the Void.",
["id"] = "s8_4077",
["timestamp"] = 1774413481,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Lonelylitten-Stormrage",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "NightElf",
["class"] = "MONK",
["name"] = "Highwaym-Stormrage",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_WHISPER_INFORM",
["type"] = "WHISPER",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "To |Hplayer:Highwaym-Stormrage:842:WHISPER:HIGHWAYM-STORMRAGE|h[|cff00ff98Highwaym|r]|h: that's crazy though",
["id"] = "s8_4078",
["timestamp"] = 1774413483,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Lonelylitten-Stormrage",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Unknown",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Unknown yells: Ah, and my favorite champions as well! I was afraid you might miss this.",
["id"] = "s8_4079",
["timestamp"] = 1774413487,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Lonelylitten-Stormrage",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Umbric",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Magister Umbric says: After what happened with Turalyon and Arator... I can see how Alleria would struggle to maintain control. I doubt I'd be able to, if it were me.",
["id"] = "s8_4080",
["timestamp"] = 1774413491,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Lonelylitten-Stormrage",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Alleria Windrunner",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Alleria Windrunner grimaces in pain.",
["id"] = "s8_4081",
["timestamp"] = 1774413492,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Lonelylitten-Stormrage",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Arator",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Arator yells: What are you doing to her?!",
["id"] = "s8_4082",
["timestamp"] = 1774413493,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Lonelylitten-Stormrage",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Xal'atath",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Xal'atath yells: Keeping my promise, of course. Taking everything she loves. Leaving her with nothing but the Void.",
["id"] = "s8_4083",
["timestamp"] = 1774413495,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Lonelylitten-Stormrage",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "NightElf",
["class"] = "MONK",
["name"] = "Highwaym-Stormrage",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_WHISPER",
["type"] = "WHISPER",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Highwaym-Stormrage:848:WHISPER:HIGHWAYM-STORMRAGE|h[|cff00ff98Highwaym|r]|h whispers: yeah you have to wait till each ults once",
["id"] = "s8_4084",
["timestamp"] = 1774413500,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Lonelylitten-Stormrage",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Umbric",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Magister Umbric says: Still, should Xal'atath succeed, and Alleria loses her grip on the dark naaru within her... I fear all may be lost.",
["id"] = "s8_4085",
["timestamp"] = 1774413501,
},
