E\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_BOSS_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.8666667342185974,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"A Darkmoon Ride Ticket has been consumed.\",\"id\":\"s0_902\",\"timestamp\":1772735374},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Jay Maguire\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Jay Maguire yells: One minute till Blight Boar takes the stage! Join us in the Cauldron of Rock on the east side of the island.\",\"id\":\"s0_903\",\"timestamp\":1772735395},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Michael Schweitzer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Michael Schweitzer yells: The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in thirty minutes!\",\"id\":\"s0_904\",\"timestamp\":1772735449},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Jay Maguire\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Jay Maguire yells: My rockin' and rollin' beauties! You're in the right place to melt your face! Allow me to humbly introduce... Blight Booooar!\",\"id\":\"s0_905\",\"timestamp\":1772735459},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Death Metal Knight\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Death Metal Knight yells: I will prove once and for all that only a knight from the grave can rule heavy metal.\",\"id\":\"s0_906\",\"timestamp\":1772735467},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Death Metal Knight\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Death Metal Knight yells: Fight though you might, your bodies will freeze and shatter!\",\"id\":\"s0_907\",\"timestamp\":1772735491},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Death Metal Knight\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Death Metal Knight yells: You have failed, Blight Boar.  Your fans now serve my armies of the dead!\",\"id\":\"s0_908\",\"timestamp\":1772735561},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.6666666865348816,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Barelynoer|h[Barelynoer]: |h|A:ping_chat_nonthreat:0:0:0:0|aLook here\",\"timestamp\":1772735762,\"id\":\"s0_909\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: The Terrace holds what we require to gain entry to the Voidstorm... the Cynosure of Twilight.\",\"timestamp\":1772735999,\"id\":\"s0_910\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arcane Sentry\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Arcane Sentry yells: Unauthorized entry. Swift action will be taken.\",\"timestamp\":1772736010,\"id\":\"s0_911\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: You were warned, Umbric! The Terrace is forever closed to you! Now leave before--\",\"timestamp\":1772736033,\"id\":\"s0_912\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Of course he left a message for me. I'm afraid you'll have to incapacitate the guards.\",\"timestamp\":1772736040,\"id\":\"s0_913\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"EarthenDwarf\",\"name\":\"Vàlâk-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Vàlâk receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260668::::::::85:1473:::::::::|h[Cloudy Purple Gem]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1772736091,\"id\":\"s0_914\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Blazing Pyromancer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Blazing Pyromancer yells: Who is causing all this noise in the library?\",\"timestamp\":1772736094,\"id\":\"s0_915\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_TARGETICONS\",\"type\":\"TARGETICONS\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Xxpeanut|h[Xxpeanut]|h sets |TInterface\\\\TargetingFrame\\\\UI-RaidTargetingIcon_6:0|t on Vàlâk.\",\"timestamp\":1772736102,\"id\":\"s0_916\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vigilant Librarian\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vigilant Librarian says: Shhhh!\",\"timestamp\":1772736107,\"id\":\"s0_917\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vigilant Librarian\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vigilant Librarian says: Be quiet!\",\"timestamp\":1772736117,\"id\":\"s0_9