1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Arcanotron Custos yells: Security... failure...\",\"timestamp\":1772736266,\"id\":\"s0_929\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"EarthenDwarf\",\"name\":\"Vàlâk-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Vàlâk receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260650::::::::85:1473:::::::::|h[Elemental Debris]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1772736268,\"id\":\"s0_930\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:251104::::::::85:1473::17:3:13441:13436:13578:2:9:85:28:3022:::::|h[Leggings of Orderly Conduct]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772736268,\"id\":\"s0_931\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 17 Gold, 50 Silver, 65 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1772736269,\"id\":\"s0_932\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: A crude solution, but effective. The Cynosure should be just ahead.\",\"timestamp\":1772736269,\"id\":\"s0_933\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Seranel Sunlash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Seranel Sunlash yells: They must not reach the Cynosure of Twilight!\",\"timestamp\":1772736280,\"id\":\"s0_934\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Seranel Sunlash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Seranel Sunlash yells: Stop them!\",\"timestamp\":1772736282,\"id\":\"s0_935\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Seranel! Stand down! I have permission from Lor'themar himself!\",\"timestamp\":1772736355,\"id\":\"s0_936\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Seranel Sunlash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Seranel Sunlash says: Liar! None shall lay hands on the Cynosure!\",\"timestamp\":1772736360,\"id\":\"s0_937\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Seranel Sunlash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Seranel Sunlash yells: You shall not--\",\"timestamp\":1772736431,\"id\":\"s0_938\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:251110::::::::85:1473::17:3:13441:13436:13578:2:9:85:28:3022:::::|h[Sunlash's Sunsash]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772736434,\"id\":\"s0_939\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric yells: Help me remove the wards around the Cynosure!\",\"timestamp\":1772736434,\"id\":\"s0_940\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 29 Gold, 60 Silver, 52 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1772736435,\"id\":\"s0_941\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arcane Magister\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Arcane Magister yells: Seranel, the Void has broken through! We--we're too late...\",\"timestamp\":1772736460,\"id\":\"s0_942\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric yells: Something's gone terribly wrong... Go. I'll catch up once I find a way to fix this.\",\"timestamp\":1772736466,\"id\":\"s0_943\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Xxpeanut-Area52\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Xxpeanut receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260638::::::::85:1473:::::::::|h[Fine Void Residue]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1772736487,\"id\":\"s0_944\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Xxpeanut-Area52\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Xxpeanut receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260677::::::::85:1473:::::::::|h[Void Flakes]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1772736487,\"id\":\"s0_945\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Xxpeanut-Area52\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},