"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 35 Gold, 25 Silver, 82 Copper\",\"id\":\"s0_1595\",\"timestamp\":1772755745},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:3214|h[Loot]|h: You have selected Greed for: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264717::::::::87:1473::17:::::::|h[Amani Warding Hex]|h|r |HlootHistory:3214|h|cnLOOT_LINK_COLOR:[View Loot Rolls]|r|h\",\"id\":\"s0_1596\",\"timestamp\":1772755748},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: With de creature dead an' de Vilebranch gone, we Witherbark all be sleepin' a little safer--for now.\",\"id\":\"s0_1597\",\"timestamp\":1772755748},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: We will always be lookin' over our shoulders at de Vilebranch. Come back with me. De chief be havin' a reward for ya.\",\"id\":\"s0_1598\",\"timestamp\":1772755758},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:3214|h[Loot]|h: Zulclaw (Need - 69, Main-Spec) Won: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264717::::::::87:1473::17:::::::|h[Amani Warding Hex]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_1599\",\"timestamp\":1772755771},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ranger Telenus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ranger Telenus says: Look at this mess!\",\"timestamp\":1772756825,\"id\":\"s0_1600\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: This area is compromised. It is vital to our mission that you secure it.\",\"timestamp\":1772756848,\"id\":\"s0_1601\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:247713::::::::87:1473:::::::::|h[Reliquary of Darkness]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772756880,\"id\":\"s0_1602\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lucia Nightbreaker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lucia Nightbreaker says: Kalgorg began to disobey me when we entered this world. Help me sacrifice it. It's useless to us.\",\"timestamp\":1772756880,\"id\":\"s0_1603\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kalgorg\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kalgorg says: No more. Our pact is forfeit, Nightbreaker. I will claim the power that waits within that den for myself.\",\"timestamp\":1772756885,\"id\":\"s0_1604\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lucia Nightbreaker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lucia Nightbreaker says: Ungrateful beast! You think you can break our contract? After it!\",\"timestamp\":1772756892,\"id\":\"s0_1605\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lucia Nightbreaker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lucia Nightbreaker says: Kalgorg entered here, but do not descend into the cave just yet. We have preparations to make on the surface.\",\"timestamp\":1772756919,\"id\":\"s0_1606\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:246435::::::::87:1473:::::::::|h[Reliquary of Darkness]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772756963,\"id\":\"s0_1607\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lucia Nightbreaker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lucia Nightbreaker says: Do not descend into the cave yet. Empower my relic here on the surface, and I will use it to empower us in the fight below.\",\"timestamp\":1772756964,\"id\":\"s0_1608\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:250319::::::::87:1473::::1:28:3321:::::|h[Researcher's Shadowgraft]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772757007,\"id\":\"s0_1609\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"EarthenDwarf\",\"name\":\"Demonpotato-Korgath\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Demonpotato-Korgath|h[|cff8788eeDemonpotato-Korgath|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:32:Player-