got a new shipment!\",\"timestamp\":1772766009,\"id\":\"s0_1988\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Darkmoon Faire Greeter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Darkmoon Faire Greeter says: Welcome to the Darkmoon Faire, evoker!\",\"timestamp\":1772766032,\"id\":\"s0_1989\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mola\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_RAID_BOSS_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_BOSS_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.8666667342185974,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Please stay out of the gaming area.\",\"timestamp\":1772766086,\"id\":\"s0_1990\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Duquan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Duquan says: They should aim the cannon straight up.\",\"timestamp\":1772766087,\"id\":\"s0_1991\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Jay Maguire\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Jay Maguire yells: One minute till Blight Boar takes the stage! Join us in the Cauldron of Rock on the east side of the island.\",\"id\":\"s0_1992\",\"timestamp\":1772767767},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Michael Schweitzer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Michael Schweitzer yells: The Tauren Chieftains concert will begin in thirty minutes!\",\"id\":\"s0_1993\",\"timestamp\":1772767822},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Jay Maguire\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Jay Maguire yells: My rockin' and rollin' beauties! You're in the right place to melt your face! Allow me to humbly introduce... Blight Booooar!\",\"id\":\"s0_1994\",\"timestamp\":1772767833},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Death Metal Knight\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Death Metal Knight yells: I will prove once and for all that only a knight from the grave can rule heavy metal.\",\"id\":\"s0_1995\",\"timestamp\":1772767842},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Death Metal Knight\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Death Metal Knight yells: Fight though you might, your bodies will freeze and shatter!\",\"id\":\"s0_1996\",\"timestamp\":1772767865},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kae Ti\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kae Ti says: Have a merry time on the merry-go-round!\",\"id\":\"s0_1997\",\"timestamp\":1772767909},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Death Metal Knight\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Death Metal Knight yells: You have failed, Blight Boar.  Your fans now serve my armies of the dead!\",\"id\":\"s0_1998\",\"timestamp\":1772767918},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kae Ti\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kae Ti says: Have a merry time on the merry-go-round!\",\"id\":\"s0_1999\",\"timestamp\":1772767940},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Thaddeus Paleo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Thaddeus Paleo says: Come speak with me if you have any Darkmoon Faire Cards.\",\"id\":\"s0_2000\",\"timestamp\":1772767963},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kae Ti\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kae Ti says: Ride tickets for sale! Come get your ride tickets!\",\"id\":\"s0_2001\",\"timestamp\":1772767982},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Maxima Blastenheimer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Maxima Blastenheimer says: Step up to get blown up!\",\"id\":\"s0_2002\",\"timestamp\":1772767989},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Maxima Blastenheimer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Maxima Blastenheimer says: Don't worry about your weight, this cannon can handle any payload!\",\"id\":\"s0_2003\",\"timestamp\":1772768021},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Duquan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Duquan says: Why don't people get shot out of cannons all the time?\",\"id\":\"s0_2004\",\"timestamp\":1772768027},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Darkmoon Carnie\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Darkmoon Carnie says: Having a good time?\",\"id\":\"s0_2005\",\"timestamp\":1772768046},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Maxima Blastenheimer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Maxima Blastenheimer says: Transportation to the other end of the faire!\",\"id\":\"s0_2006\",\"timestamp\":1772768055},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Maxima Blastenheimer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Maxima Blastenheimer says: Cannon blast!  Who wants to get shot out of a cannon?\",\"id\":\"s0_2007\",\"timestamp\":1772768092},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Maxima Blastenheimer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Maxima Blastenheimer says: Transportation to the other end of the faire!\",\"id\":\"s0_2008\",\"timestamp\":1772768124},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Randy\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Randy says: What are the cannon balls for?  Do they let you carry one?\",\"id\":\"s0_2009\",\"timestamp\":1772768153},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Maxima Blastenheimer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Maxima Blastenheimer says: Cannon blast!  Who wants to get shot out of a cannon?\",\"id\":\"s0_2010\",\"timestamp\":1772768182},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Maxima Blastenheimer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Maxima Blastenheimer says: Don't worry about y