Warding Hex]|h|r |HlootHistory:3214|h|cnLOOT_LINK_COLOR:[View Loot Rolls]|r|h\",\"timestamp\":1772776503,\"id\":\"s0_2434\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: With de creature dead an' de Vilebranch gone, we Witherbark all be sleepin' a little safer--for now.\",\"timestamp\":1772776504,\"id\":\"s0_2435\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:3214|h[Loot]|h: Kritykat (Need - 43, Main-Spec) Won: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264717::::::::89:1473::17:::::::|h[Amani Warding Hex]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772776509,\"id\":\"s0_2436\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Blckreaper-Area52\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_INSTANCE_CHAT\",\"type\":\"INSTANCE_CHAT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.4980392456054688,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:INSTANCE_CHAT|h[Instance]|h |Hplayer:Blckreaper-Area52:904:INSTANCE_CHAT:|h[|cffa330c9Blckreaper|r]|h: ty\",\"timestamp\":1772776510,\"id\":\"s0_2437\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: We will always be lookin' over our shoulders at de Vilebranch. Come back with me. De chief be havin' a reward for ya.\",\"timestamp\":1772776514,\"id\":\"s0_2438\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: These ethereals provide the power for Xal'atath's forces. Destroy them, and their machines.\",\"timestamp\":1772776522,\"id\":\"s0_2439\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1772776535,\"id\":\"s0_2440\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ziadan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ziadan says: That looks like a treasure out in the distance. Don't miss this opportunity!\",\"timestamp\":1772776568,\"id\":\"s0_2441\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Unraveling Captive\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Unraveling Captive says: The Void devours its own. We have nothing left.\",\"timestamp\":1772776574,\"id\":\"s0_2442\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Unraveling Captive\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Unraveling Captive says: Is this what you wanted, Salhadaar?\",\"timestamp\":1772776587,\"id\":\"s0_2443\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Unraveling Captive\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Unraveling Captive says: Xal'atath has taken control. Our people are lost.\",\"timestamp\":1772776596,\"id\":\"s0_2444\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"