|h says: 40.20, 61,21\",\"timestamp\":1772831079,\"id\":\"s0_3040\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1772831124,\"id\":\"s0_3041\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Goldenmist Vintner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Goldenmist Vintner says: Innkeeper Areyn is the founder of our estate.\",\"timestamp\":1772831152,\"id\":\"s0_3042\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Goldenmist Vintner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Goldenmist Vintner says: For her very first vintage, she picked perfect ten grapes.\",\"timestamp\":1772831155,\"id\":\"s0_3043\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Goldenmist Vintner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Goldenmist Vintner says: In honor of old fashions, she then stomped on them to mash and blend the mixture!\",\"timestamp\":1772831159,\"id\":\"s0_3044\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:256232::::::::90:1473:::::::::|h[Bunch of Ripe Grapes]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772831161,\"id\":\"s0_3045\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Goldenmist Vintner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Goldenmist Vintner says: Fermentation can take years. But our vintners made a special yeast that acts VERY quickly and efficiently, without compromising quality.\",\"timestamp\":1772831165,\"id\":\"s0_3046\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Goldenmist Vintner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Goldenmist Vintner says: Innkeeper Areyn is the founder of our estate.\",\"id\":\"s0_3047\",\"timestamp\":1772854091},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Goldenmist Vintner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Goldenmist Vintner says: For her very first vintage, she picked perfect ten grapes.\",\"id\":\"s0_3048\",\"timestamp\":1772854094},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Goldenmist Vintner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Goldenmist Vintner says: In honor of old fashions, she then stomped on them to mash and blend the mixture!\",\"id\":\"s0_3049\",\"timestamp\":1772854098},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Goldenmist Vintner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Goldenmist Vintner says: Fermentation can take years. But our vintners made a special yeast that acts VERY quickly and efficiently, without compromising quality.\",\"id\":\"s0_3050\",\"timestamp\":1772854104},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Goldenmist Vintner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Goldenmist Vintner says: As part of your tour, a packet of this magical yeast is purchasable from Sheri, our general goods vendor. We promise you full results or a full refund.\",\"id\":\"s0_3051\",\"timestamp\":1772854114},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Goldenmist Vintner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Goldenmist Vintner says: After adding the yeast to the vat, Areyn's first vintage was ready.\",\"id\":\"s0_3052\",\"timestamp\":1772854125},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Goldenmist Vintner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Goldenmist Vintner says: Since then, she's made over hundreds of different kinds--but if you know her, you'll know that the classic, no fuss red is still her favorite.\",\"id\":\"s0_3053\",\"timestamp\":1772854130},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:256232::::::::90:1473:::::::::|h[Bunch of Ripe Grapes]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_3054\",\"timestamp\":1772854167},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s0_3055\",\"timestamp\":1772854170},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Kalis-Azshara\",\"sex\":2},\"