acekeeper of our family. She spent many days tending to the gardens here, but the wilderness has overtaken it now.\",\"id\":\"s0_3067\",\"timestamp\":1772854810},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Kalis-Azshara\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Kalis-Azshara receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::90:1473:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s0_3068\",\"timestamp\":1772854859},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Cindyrdh-Illidan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Cindyrdh-Illidan receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260665::::::::90:1473:::::::::|h[Sizable Tusk]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s0_3069\",\"timestamp\":1772854859},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Kalis-Azshara\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Kalis-Azshara receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260692::::::::90:1473:::::::::|h[Chunk of Mystery Meat]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s0_3070\",\"timestamp\":1772854860},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Ottertotem-Illidan\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Ottertotem-Illidan receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260665::::::::90:1473:::::::::|h[Sizable Tusk]|h|rx2.\",\"id\":\"s0_3071\",\"timestamp\":1772854862},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Cindyrdh-Illidan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\