ver, 98 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1772949172,\"id\":\"s0_4121\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ4:|Hcurrency:3341:0|h[Veteran Dawncrest]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1772949172,\"id\":\"s0_4122\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:256759::::::::90:1473::23::1:28:3025:::::|h[Formula: Enchant Weapon - Flames of the Sin'dorei]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772949174,\"id\":\"s0_4123\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: We will always be lookin' over our shoulders at de Vilebranch. Come back with me. De chief be havin' a reward for ya.\",\"timestamp\":1772949175,\"id\":\"s0_4124\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:3214|h[Loot]|h: You passed on: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264717::::::::90:1473::23:::::::|h[Amani Warding Hex]|h|r |HlootHistory:3214|h|cnLOOT_LINK_COLOR:[View Loot Rolls]|r|h\",\"timestamp\":1772949207,\"id\":\"s0_4125\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:3214|h[Loot]|h: Cindyrdh (Need - 90, Main-Spec) Won: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264717::::::::90:1473::23:::::::|h[Amani Warding Hex]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772949207,\"id\":\"s0_4126\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"