\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Jiangchen-Illidan|h[|cffc41e3aJiangchen-Illidan|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61639:Player-57-0A5503C3:1:3:7:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Maisara Caverns]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s0_4132\",\"timestamp\":1772949715},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: My sisters were the last to visit these halls, but they threw their home and their bond away. If we can calm the spirits here, maybe they'll return.\",\"id\":\"s0_4133\",\"timestamp\":1772949811},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: The Ranger-General was sharp and steadfast, while the peacekeeper kept the calm. Which path will you choose?\",\"id\":\"s0_4134\",\"timestamp\":1772949826},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Anabolyc-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Anabolyc-Tichondrius|h[|cff33937fAnabolyc-Tichondrius|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61647:Player-11-0E44A7A1:1:3:7:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Mythic: Nexus-Point Xenas]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s0_4135\",\"timestamp\":1772949893},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Anabolyc-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Anabolyc-Tichondrius|h[|cff33937fAnabolyc-Tichondrius|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61646:Player-11-0E44A7A1:1:3:7:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Heroic: Nexus-Point Xenas]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s0_4136\",\"timestamp\":1772949893},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Vereesa was the peacekeeper of our family. She spent many days tending to the gardens here, but the wilderness has overtaken it now.\",\"id\":\"s0_4137\",\"timestamp\":1772949934},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Georgious-Korgath\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Georgious-Korgath receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260647::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Digested Human Hand]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s0_4138\",\"timestamp\":1772949978},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Georgious-Korgath\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Georgious-Korgath receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s0_4139\",\"timestamp\":1772949978},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Cinderelly-Illidan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Cinderelly-Illidan receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Practical