,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: A large attack only causes the Lightbloom to spread. A few, striking the most dangerous--that is best.\",\"id\":\"s1_2850\",\"timestamp\":1773112513},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Waldoqq-Illidan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Waldoqq-Illidan receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:258859::::::::90:1473::23:1:13611:2:9:90:28:3322:::::|h[Threadbare Mitts]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s1_2851\",\"timestamp\":1773112562},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Radiant Spellsower\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Radiant Spellsower yells: Lashers! Bloom and grow!\",\"id\":\"s1_2852\",\"timestamp\":1773112564},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Radiant Spellsower\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Radiant Spellsower yells: The garden must feed!\",\"id\":\"s1_2853\",\"timestamp\":1773112570},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Lutsocks-Area52\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Lutsocks receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242640::::::::90:1473:::::::::|h[Plant Protein]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s1_2854\",\"timestamp\":1773112573},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Syldaris-Illidan\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Syldaris-Illidan receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem