 Silver, 26 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1773176510,\"id\":\"s1_3595\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ4:|Hcurrency:3341:0|h[Veteran Dawncrest]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1773176510,\"id\":\"s1_3596\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:3074|h[Loot]|h: You have selected Greed for: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:263230::::::::90:105::23:::::::|h[Magister's Bookshelf]|h|r |HlootHistory:3074|h|cnLOOT_LINK_COLOR:[View Loot Rolls]|r|h\",\"timestamp\":1773176513,\"id\":\"s1_3597\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: ...and perhaps offer an apology for the near catastrophe.\",\"timestamp\":1773176517,\"id\":\"s1_3598\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:3074|h[Loot]|h: Highwaym (Need - 52, Main-Spec) Won: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:263230::::::::90:105::23:::::::|h[Magister's Bookshelf]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1773176519,\"id\":\"s1_3599\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Highwaym-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Highwaym receives loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:263230::::::::90:105::23:::::::|h[Magister's Bookshelf]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773176519,\"id\":\"s1_3600\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Messenger Aelor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Messenger Aelor says: Hello? Lonelylitten? Can you hear me? I bring a message from Magister Umbric!\",\"timestamp\":1773176545,\"id\":\"s1_3601\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Nicktewdh-Illidan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY\",\"type\":\"PARTY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.6666666865348816,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party]|h |Hplayer:Nicktewdh-Illidan:6089:PARTY:|h[|cffa330c9Nicktewdh-Illidan|r]|h: |cff71d5ff|Hspell:390152:0|h[Collective Anguish]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1773176622,\"id\":\"s1_3602\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Heficore-Zul'jin\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Heficore-Zul'jin|h[|cff0070ddHeficore-Zul'jin|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61800:Player-61-0E4D785F:1:3:10:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 4 (Season 1)]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773176849,\"id\":\"s1_3603\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: My sisters were the last to visit these halls, but they threw their home and their bond away. If we can calm the spirits here, maybe they'll return.\",\"timestamp\":1773176859,\"id\":\"s1_3604\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: The Ranger-General was sharp and steadfast, while the peacekeeper kept the calm. Which path will you choose?\",\"timestamp\":1773176870,\"id\":\"s1_3605\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Sylvanas didn't ask to be Ranger-General, but she gave everything to the task... including her life.\",\"timestamp\":1773176915,\"id\":\"s1_3606\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: She trained with a bow gifted by our mother. Undead fanatics have invaded to loot it, and anything else that belonged to her.\",\"timestamp\":1773176930,\"id\":\"s1_3607\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Frostyfae-Illidan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Frostyfae-Illidan receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260660::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Putrid Mushroom Spores]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773176974,\"id\":\"s1_3608\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Frostyfae-Illidan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Frostyfae-Illidan receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260685::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Large Brittle Bone]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773176975,\"id\":\"s1_3609\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Heficore-Zul'jin\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Heficore-Zul'jin|h[|cff0070ddHeficore-Zul'jin|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62269:Player-61-0E4D785F:1:3:10:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Altar of Blessings: Amani Curious]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773176977,\"id\":\"s1_3610\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Our mother's bow meant everything to Sylvanas, once. I'll need it.\",\"timestamp\":1773177053,\"id\":\"s1_3611\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Latch\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Latch yells: Latch... sorry...\",\"timestamp\":1773177139,\"id\":\"s1_3612\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Impuratus-Alleria\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Impuratus-Alleria receives loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:250226::::::::90:105::23:4:12779:13439:6652:12699:1:28:3025:::::|h[Latch's Crooked Hook]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773177141,\"id\":\"s1_3613\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:251083::::::::90:105::23:4:12779:13439:6652:12701:1:28:3025:::::|h[Excavating Cudgel]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1773177142,\"id\":\"s1_3614\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 21 Gold, 21 Silver, 96 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1773177142,\"id\":\"s1_3615\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Sylvanas was sometimes vain, and loved to be admired, but she never wanted to be worshipped.\",\"timestamp\":1773177143,\"id\":\"s1_3616\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Come, let's find the next relic.\",\"timestamp\":1773177151,\"id\":\"s1_3617\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Heficore-Zul'jin\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Heficore-Zul'jin|h[|cff0070ddHeficore-Zul'jin|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62270:Player-61-0E4D785F:1:3:10:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Altar of Blessings: One for Altar]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773177155,\"id\":\"s1_3618\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Vereesa was the peacekeeper of our family. She spent many days tending to the gardens here, but the wilderness has overtaken it now.\",\"timestamp\":1773177184,\"id\":\"s1_3619\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Kovieyd-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kovieyd-Stormrage|h[|cffff7c0aKovieyd|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:1243:Player-60-0FDB33A0:1:3:10:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Fish Don't Leave Footprints]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773177254,\"id\":\"s1_3620\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Frostyfae-Illidan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Frostyfae-Illidan receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx2.\",\"timestamp\":1773177264,\"id\":\"s1_3621\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: The soothing sounds of my harp brought Vereesa joy beyond measure. I'll need that relic.\",\"timestamp\":1773177265,\"id\":\"s1_3622\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Frostyfae-Illidan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Frostyfae-Illidan receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx2.\",\"timestamp\":1773177328,\"id\":\"s1_3623\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Well now--that dragonhawk seems to have stolen my harp. She won't let you close without a fight.\",\"timestamp\":1773177331,\"id\":\"s1_3624\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Beautiful! She reminds me of Vereesa. My sister was also ferocity itself if her family was threatened.\",\"timestamp\":1773177400,\"id\":\"s1_3625\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Frostyfae-Illidan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Frostyfae-Illidan receives loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:251080::::::::90:105::23:6:12779:13439:6652:13534:12699:13577:1:28:3022:::::|h[Brambledawn Halo]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773177404,\"id\":\"s1_3626\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 12 Gold, 43 Silver, 72 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1773177404,\"id\":\"s1_3627\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Come, we have one more relic to find.\",\"timestamp\":1773177409,\"id\":\"s1_3628\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1773177423,\"id\":\"s1_3629\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylit