78846,\"id\":\"s1_3725\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: She's dead, but her evil lives on.\",\"timestamp\":1773178848,\"id\":\"s1_3726\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: There still be many angry souls. I will keep them busy--an' keep them from feedin' de monster.\",\"timestamp\":1773178851,\"id\":\"s1_3727\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zaib'yan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Zaib'yan yells: Interlopers! You will never reach Rak'tul!\",\"timestamp\":1773178853,\"id\":\"s1_3728\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: But de monster be up to you.\",\"timestamp\":1773178858,\"id\":\"s1_3729\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Impuratus-Alleria\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Impuratus-Alleria receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773178904,\"id\":\"s1_3730\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Impuratus-Alleria\",\