itten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:3214|h[Loot]|h: Impuratus (Need - 21, Main-Spec) Won: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264717::::::::90:105::23:::::::|h[Amani Warding Hex]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1773179088,\"id\":\"s1_3751\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Impuratus-Alleria\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Impuratus-Alleria receives loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264717::::::::90:105::23:::::::|h[Amani Warding Hex]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773179088,\"id\":\"s1_3752\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: We will always be lookin' over our shoulders at de Vilebranch. Come back with me. De chief be havin' a reward for ya.\",\"timestamp\":1773179093,\"id\":\"s1_3753\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Messenger Aelor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Messenger Aelor says: Hello? Lonelylitten? Can you hear me? I bring a message from Magister Umbric!\",\"timestamp\":1773179126,\"id\":\"s1_3754\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Nicktewdh-Illidan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY\",\"type\":\"PARTY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.6666666865348816,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party]|h |Hplayer:Nicktewdh-Illidan:6362:PARTY:|h[|cffa330c9Nicktewdh-Illidan|r]|h: 123 123\",\"timestamp\":1773179126,\"id\":\"s1_3755\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY\",\"type\":\"PARTY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.6666666865348816,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party]|h |Hplayer:Lonelylitten-Stormrage:6363:PARTY:|h[|cffff7c0aLonelylitten|r]|h: ABC ABC\",\"timestamp\":1773179135,\"id\":\"s1_3756\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Bumlock-BleedingHollow\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Bumlock-BleedingHollow|h[|cff8788eeBumlock-BleedingHollow|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61312:Player-73-072CF71C:1:3:10:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Center Stager]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773179188,\"id\":\"s1_3757\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1773179304,\"id\":\"s1_3758\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Do not worry about your friend, de would-be hash'ey. Nalorakk, de dreamer, de Loa of War, will test her strength.\",\"timestamp\":1773179333,\"id\":\"s1_3759\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: A hash'ey is only as strong as their warriors. So, you too will be tested in Nalorakk's dream.\",\"timestamp\":1773179344,\"id\":\"s1_3760\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: The loa dreams of de Amani's past. When de winter was their only foe. Preparin' for it will be your first trial.\",\"timestamp\":1773179353,\"id\":\"s1_3761\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Leftclick-Zul'jin\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Leftclick-Zul'jin|h[|cff3fc7ebLeftclick-Zul'jin|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61809:Player-61-07914198:1:3:10:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Adventurer of the Dawn]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773179358,\"id\":\"s1_3762\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Impuratus-Alleria\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Impuratus-Alleria receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|rx2.\",\"timestamp\":1773179530,\"id\":\"s1_3763\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Highwaym-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Highwaym receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773179530,\"id\":\"s1_3764\"},{\"rec