e\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: A good kill, Barelynoer. And I rescued all that were still alive. But why did Muro'jin bring them here?\",\"timestamp\":1773288167,\"id\":\"s2_2881\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Troll\",\"name\":\"Butbutt-Turalyon\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Butbutt-Turalyon receives loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:251167::::::::90:1473::23:5:12779:13439:6652:12699:13577:1:28:3025:::::|h[Nightprey Stalkers]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773288167,\"id\":\"s2_2882\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: De kidnapping won't stop until we get to de root of de evil. Follow me.\",\"timestamp\":1773288175,\"id\":\"s2_2883\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rokh'zal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Rokh'zal yells: You cannot stop de ritual! Spirits, rise!\",\"timestamp\":1773288187,\"id\":\"s2_2884\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: That... not be natural. And the energy flowing into it... This is hex magic.\",\"timestamp\":1773288189,\"id\":\"s2_2885\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\"