},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Unknown says: I do enjoy a good stroll about town. Let's see what plots are available.\",\"timestamp\":1773365122,\"id\":\"s2_3509\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: And if you have any questions or find your options are too limited, please speak with me.\",\"timestamp\":1773365129,\"id\":\"s2_3510\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: The locals have dubbed this hill the Small Aerie. Flocks of gryphons naturally tend to roost here.\",\"timestamp\":1773365150,\"id\":\"s2_3511\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Lonelylitten-Stormrage|h[|cffff7c0aLonelylitten|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61211:Player-60-0F85ABEF:1:3:12:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Welcome Home]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773365161,\"id\":\"s2_3512\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Lonelylitten-Stormrage|h[|cffff7c0aLonelylitten|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:612