},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:259114::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Lush Green Dye]|h|rx3\",\"timestamp\":1773365233,\"id\":\"s2_3518\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:259126::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Void Violet Dye]|h|rx3\",\"timestamp\":1773365233,\"id\":\"s2_3519\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Local\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Local says: It is always good for one to have a place to call home. I wish you well.\",\"timestamp\":1773365244,\"id\":\"s2_3520\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: If you want to procure more exotic furnishings, you should speak with the Last Architect. They have connections far and wide.\",\"timestamp\":1773365245,\"id\":\"s2_3521\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: We also have some... well, some smugglers who are selling items from the Horde. I promise to look the other way if you visit them.\",\"timestamp\":1773365255,\"id\":\"s2_3522\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"\\\"High Tides\\\" Ren\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"\\\"High Tides\\\" Ren says: We just got something special in from Vol'dun. Would you care to have a look?\",\"timestamp\":1773365327,\"id\":\"s2_3523\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:244778::::::::90:105::14::1:28:4285:::::|h[Sethraliss Priest's Pillow]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1773365334,\"id\":\"s2_3524\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: I have one final matter I'd like to discuss regarding your house, if you please.\",\"timestamp\":1773365337,\"id\":\"s2_3525\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: Speak to Jorvan Longmoor. His ancestors built the first homes here. I dare say you won't find a better craftsman on the island.\",\"timestamp\":1773365370,\"id\":\"s2_3526\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: Down the road, you may have need of Jorvan again. Just return to him whenever you are ready to expand your house.\",\"timestamp\":1773365380,\"id\":\"s2_3527\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Jorvan Longmoor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":