aella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: We are deep in enemy territory. Time to strike!\",\"id\":\"s2_4414\",\"timestamp\":1773382952},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Here the very fabric of reality is chaotic and malformed. We could use your help studying the residue of such anomalies.\",\"id\":\"s2_4415\",\"timestamp\":1773382968},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s2_4416\",\"timestamp\":1773382968},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: The Shadowguard's machinations continue in spite of our best efforts. Disrupt their operations.\",\"id\":\"s2_4417\",\"timestamp\":1773382994},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:238592::::::::90:1473::::1:28:3615:::::|h[Patterns: Beyond the Void]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s2_4418\",\"timestamp\":1773383039},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: These invaders are not protected by Zul'jarra. They forfeited that right by invading. Give them no ground!\",\"id\":\"s2_4419\",\"timestamp\":1773383104},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s2_4420\",\"timestamp\":1773383116},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:250922::::::::90:1473::14::1:28:3086:::::|h[Whisper of the Loa: Leatherworking]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s2_4421\",\"timestamp\":1773383193},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3157:0|h[Midnight Leatherworking Knowledge]|h|rx10\",\"id\":\"s2_4422\",\"timestamp\":1773383203},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3157:0|h[Midnight Leatherworking Knowledge]|h|rx3\",\"id\":\"s2_4423\",\"timestamp\":1773383204},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3263:0|h[Artisan Leatherworker's Moxie]|h|rx15\",\"id\":\"s2_4424\",\"timestamp\":1773383204},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"rac