Cindyrcrafts|h[Cindyrcrafts]: |h|A:ping_chat_onmyway:0:0:0:0|aOn my way\",\"id\":\"s3_3164\",\"timestamp\":1773523700},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: In de winter there were those like de Hoardmonger whose greed burdened others.\",\"id\":\"s3_3165\",\"timestamp\":1773523760},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Healslut-Deathwing\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Healslut-Deathwing receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:238511::::::::83:1480::::1:38:13:::::|h[Void-Tempered Leather |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_3166\",\"timestamp\":1773523766},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: De Amani hash'ey used their most trusted warriors to eliminate them. For de good of de tribe.\",\"id\":\"s3_3167\",\"timestamp\":1773523767},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Well done. Like a living vine, some branches must be cut so de others may live. De tribe survives--for now.\",\"id\":\"s3_3168\",\"timestamp\":1773523893},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Orcanea-Illidan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.66666668653488