:1773549075},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Solwin Brightstitch\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Solwin Brightstitch says: Alas, if I had but one worthy customer...\",\"id\":\"s3_4271\",\"timestamp\":1773549092},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"You have gained the Classic Jewelcrafting skill.\",\"id\":\"s3_4272\",\"timestamp\":1773549101},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"You have gained the Midnight Jewelcrafting skill.\",\"id\":\"s3_4273\",\"timestamp\":1773549102},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: My sisters were the last to visit these halls, but they threw their home and their bond away. If we can calm the spirits here, maybe they'll return.\",\"id\":\"s3_4274\",\"timestamp\":1773549190},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_TARGETICONS\",\"type\":\"TARGETICONS\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Angryabsol|h[Angryabsol]|h sets |TInterface\\\\TargetingFrame\\\\UI-RaidTargetingIcon_6:0|t on Friendly.\",\"id\":\"s3_4275\",\"timestamp\":1773549194},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: The Ranger-General was sharp and steadfast, while the peacekeeper kept the calm. Which path will you choose?\",\"id\":\"s3_4276\",\"timestamp\":1773549203},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Discogoose-Thrall\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Discogoose-Thrall|h[|cff3fc7ebDiscogoose-Thrall|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61387:Player-3678-0B64334C:1:3:14:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Prey: Normal Mode I]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s3_4277\",\"timestamp\":1773549258},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Vereesa was the peacekeeper of our family. She spent many days tending to the gardens here, but the wilderness has overtaken it now.\",\"id\":\"s3_4278\",\"timestamp\":1773549266},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Anetta-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Anetta-Stormrage|h[|cfffff468Anetta|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61803:Player-60-0CB90919:1:3:14:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 7 (Season 1)]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s3_4279\",\"timestamp\":1773549299},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: The soothing sounds of my harp brought Vereesa joy beyond measure. I'll need that relic.\",\"id\":\"s3_4280\",\"timestamp\":1773549387},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Xengetsu-ScarletCrusade\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Xengetsu-ScarletCrusade receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260309::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Thrumming Plant Matter]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_4281\",\"timestamp\":1773549436},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Talandiel-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Talandiel receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:238511::::::::85:1480::::1:38:13:::::|h[Void-Tempered Leather |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx2.\",\"id\":\"s3_4282\",\"timestamp\":1773549445},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Klarrington-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Klarrington receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::85:1480:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_4283\",\"timestamp\":1773549445},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Well now--that dragonhawk seems to have stolen my harp. She won't let you close without a fight.\",\"id\":\"s3_4284\",\"timestamp\":1773549456},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Beautiful! She reminds me of Vereesa. My sister was also ferocity itself if her family was threatened.\",\"id\":\"s3_4285\",\"timestamp\":1773549554},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Warglaives has increased to 430.\",\"id\":\"s3_4286\",\"timestamp\":1773549557},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 13 Gold, 30 Silver, 59 Copper\",\"id\":\"s3_4287\",\"timestamp\":1773549560},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Xengetsu-ScarletCrusade\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Xengetsu-ScarletCrusade receives loot: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:250144::::::::86:1480::17:2:13441:13436:2:9:85:28:3023:::::|h[Emberwing Feather]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_4288\",\"timestamp\":1773549560},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Come, let's find the next relic.\",\"id\":\"s3_4289\",\"timestamp\":1773549563},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Sylvanas didn't ask to be Ranger-General, but she gave everything to the task... including her life.\",\"id\":\"s3_4290\",\"timestamp\":1773549621},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: She trained with a bow gifted by our mother. Undead fanatics have invaded to loot it, and anything else that belonged to her.\",\"id\":\"s3_4291\",\"timestamp\":1773549634},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Klarrington-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Klarrington receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260660::::::::86:1480:::::::::|h[Putrid Mushroom Spores]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_4292\",\"timestamp\":1773549689},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Xengetsu-ScarletCrusade\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Xengetsu-ScarletCrusade receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260660::::::::86:1480:::::::::|h[Putrid Mushroom Spores]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_4293\",\"timestamp\":1773549696},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Talandiel-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Talandiel receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260639::::::::86:1480:::::::::|h[Fractured Bone]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_4294\",\"timestamp\":1773549725},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Talandiel-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Talandiel receives loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:258948::::::::86:1480::133:1:13729:2:9:85:28:3022:::::|h[Tarnished Dawnlit Knife]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_4295\",\"timestamp\":1773549726},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typ