,\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: I have used de shadows to see inside de cavern. I have seen my people--dead, alive, or... both.\",\"id\":\"s3_4474\",\"timestamp\":1773551857},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: I fear they be sacrificed for some dark purpose. Come. I will guide you. We gonna rescue my people.\",\"id\":\"s3_4475\",\"timestamp\":1773551870},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Worgen\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Flamei-SilverHand\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Flamei-SilverHand receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::86:1480:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_4476\",\"timestamp\":1773551906},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Muro'jin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Muro'jin says: Another Witherbark, another bag of coin for Muro'jin.\",\"id\":\"s3_4477\",\"timestamp\":1773551956},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Heathcliff-Haomarush\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Heathcliff-Haomarush receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::86:1480:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_4478\",\"timestamp\":1773551957},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Prisoner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Witherbark Prisoner say