e\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 18 Gold, 90 Silver, 99 Copper\",\"id\":\"s3_4515\",\"timestamp\":1773552497},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: A good kill, Angryabsol. And I rescued all that were still alive. But why did Muro'jin bring them here?\",\"id\":\"s3_4516\",\"timestamp\":1773552499},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Humascus-Dalaran\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Humascus-Dalaran receives loot: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:263193::::::::86:1480::17:3:13441:13436:13578:2:9:86:28:5071:::::|h[Trollhunter's Bands]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_4517\",\"timestamp\":1773552500},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: De kidnapping won't stop until we get to de root of de evil. Follow me.\",\"id\":\"s3_4518\",\"timestamp\":1773552506},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rokh'zal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rokh'zal yells: You cannot stop de ritual! Spirits, rise!\",\"id\":\"s3_4519\",\"timestamp\":1773552519},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: That... not be natural. And the energy flowing into it... This is hex magic.\",\"id\":\"s3_4520\",\"timestamp\":1773552520},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: Using the souls of de dead in powerful magic spells... I hope this is not why they brought my kin here.\",\"id\":\"s3_4521\",\"timestamp\":1773552527},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: If de maker of that monstrosity be here, we must stop them. And make sure their creation is put down.\",\"id\":\"s3_4522\",\"timestamp\":1773552534},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: It be worse than we thought. How many of my people have died here?\",\"id\":\"s3_4523\",\"timestamp\":1773552670},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Humascus-Dalaran\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Humascus-Dalaran receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::86:1480:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_4524\",\"timestamp\":1773552670},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Humascus-Dalaran\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Humascus-Dalaran receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::86: