]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_4617\",\"timestamp\":1773554213},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Corewarden Nysarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Corewarden Nysarra yells: Must I do everything myself?\",\"id\":\"s3_4618\",\"timestamp\":1773554243},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Corewarden Nysarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Corewarden Nysarra yells: All this... for that wretched Xal'atath...\",\"id\":\"s3_4619\",\"timestamp\":1773554362},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Drpoppler-Proudmoore\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Drpoppler-Proudmoore receives loot: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:250253::::::::86:1480::17:2:13441:13436:2:9:87:28:5143:::::|h[Whisper of the Duskwraith]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s3_4620\",\"timestamp\":1773554367},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: You got the last conduit? Make sure to send them over.\",\"id\":\"s3_4621\",\"timestamp\":1773554367},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:258868::::::::86:1480::17:1:13611:2:9:86:28:3322:::::|h[Brittle Legguards]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s3_4622\",\"timestamp\":1773554368},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-S