You loot 30 Gold, 58 Silver, 83 Copper\",\"id\":\"s4_2643\",\"timestamp\":1773593062},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:3287|h[Loot]|h: You passed on: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264336::::::::88:1480::17:::::::|h[Voidlight Brazier]|h|r |HlootHistory:3287|h|cnLOOT_LINK_COLOR:[View Loot Rolls]|r|h\",\"id\":\"s4_2644\",\"timestamp\":1773593080},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:3287|h[Loot]|h: Drixdayote (Need - 82, Main-Spec) Won: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264336::::::::88:1480::17:::::::|h[Voidlight Brazier]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_2645\",\"timestamp\":1773593080},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Dis must be de fire Lilaju spoke of.\",\"id\":\"s4_2646\",\"timestamp\":1773593560},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Sit and we will start de ritual--but be ready. Dis is de Loa of War. What ever he dreams of, we must complete de trial.\",\"id\":\"s4_2647\",\"timestamp\":1773593562},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Do not worry about your friend, de would-be hash'ey. Nalorakk, de dreamer, de Loa of War, will test her strength.\",\"id\":\"s4_2648\",\"timestamp\":1773593570},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: A hash'ey is only as strong as their warriors. So, you too will be tested in Nalorakk's dream.\",\"id\":\"s4_2649\",\"timestamp\":1773593581},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"[Tank] |Hplayer:Beshoe|h[Beshoe]: |h|A:ping_chat_nonthreat:0:0:0:0|aLook here\",\"id\":\"s4_2650\",\"timestamp\":1773593581},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: The loa dreams of de Amani's past. When de winter was their only foe. Preparin' for it will be your first trial.\",\"id\":\"s4_2651\",\"timestamp\":1773593591},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Zerosense-Whisperwind\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Zerosense-Whisperwind receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260640::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Crooked Bird Talons]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_2652\",\"timestamp\":1773593643},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Zerosense-Whisperwind\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Zerosense-Whisperwind receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx2.\",\"id\":\"s4_2653\",\"timestamp\":1773593643},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"cla