a Speaker Nanea says: Seasons in de loa's mind are changin'. All you can do is take shelter from de rising winds.\",\"id\":\"s4_2684\",\"timestamp\":1773593917},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Zerosense-Whisperwind\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Zerosense-Whisperwind receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260651::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Lustrous Wildlife Pelt]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_2685\",\"timestamp\":1773593970},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Jahex-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Jahex receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260655::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Decaying Humanoid Flesh]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_2686\",\"timestamp\":1773593998},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Jahex-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Jahex receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_2687\",\"timestamp\":1773593998},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Zerosense-Whisperwind\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Zerosense-Whisperwind receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260669::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Colorless Pebbles]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_2688\",\"timestamp\":1773594045},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Zerosense-Whisperwind\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Zerosense-Whisperwind receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx2.\",\"id\":\"s4_2689\",\"timestamp\":1773594045},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Babyfat-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Babyfat receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_2690\",\"timestamp\":1773594045},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: De winter do not care who you are. Hash'ey, elder, child, beggar. It tests all.\",\"id\":\"s4_2691\",\"timestamp\":1773594048},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Impressive. You have proved your strength and endurance. But what about your loyalty?\",\"id\":\"s4_2692\",\"timestamp\":1773594119},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Beshoe-BleedingHollow\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Beshoe-BleedingHollow receives loot: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:250244::::::::88:1480::1:3:13442:13437:6652:1:28:3022:::::|h[Permafrost Essence]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_2693\",\"timestamp\":1773594120},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 14 Gold, 9 Silver, 26 Copper\",\"id\":\"s4_2694\",\"timestamp\":1773594121},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Come back to de fire. Your last trial awaits you.\",\"id\":\"s4_2695\",\"timestamp\":1773594127},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ruthless Totemcaller\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ruthless Totemcaller yells: We got some worthy challengers to face de Loa of War, now. Good luck, hash'ura!\",\"id\":\"s4_2696\",\"timestamp\":1773594147},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Babyfat-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Babyfat receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx2.\",\"id\":\"s4_2697\",\"timestamp\":1773594216},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Babyfat-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Babyfat receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:258851::::::::88:1480::17:1:13611:2:9:84:28:3322:::::|h[Stained Hauberk]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_2698\",\"timestamp\":1773594217},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Babyfat-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Babyfat receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx2.\",\"id\":\"s4_2699\",\"timestamp\":1773594222},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Babyfat-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Babyfat receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260672::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Fetid Eye]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_2700\",\"timestamp\":1773594222},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Zerosense-Whisperwind\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Zerosense-Whisperwind receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_2701\",\"timestamp\":1773594251},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Babyfat-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Babyfat receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::88:1480:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_2702\",\"timestamp\":1773594252},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Babyfat-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Babyfat receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:266223::::::::88:1480::17:1:13611:2:9:84:28:3322:::::|h[Stained Drape]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_2703\",\"timestamp\":1773594253},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: What took you so long, eh? De loa will not fight me without you.\",\"id\":\"s4_2704\",\"timestamp\":1773594254},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Hold. Before ya face de loa, ya must face an' kill... me.\",\"id\":\"s4_2705\",\"timestamp\":1773594258},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nalorakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nalorakk says: Leadership requires sacrifice. Even of the things we cherish.\",\"id\":\"s4_2706\",\"timestamp\":1773594264},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Well done, Amani cub. You have... passed de trial. Take de Burden of Nalorakk.\",\"id\":\"s4_2707\",\"timestamp\":1773594293},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nalorakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nalorakk says: She has died honorably. But the death of those loyal to me... that is my burden. It will be yours as hash'ey.\",\"id\":\"s4_2708\",\"timestamp\":1773594308},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Jahex-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Jahex-Stormrage|h[|cff8788eeJahex|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61638:Player-60-0F8D6B30:1:3:15:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Den of Nalorakk]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s4_2709\",\"timestamp\":1773594381},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Zerosense-Whisperwind\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Zerosense-Whisperwind|h[|cffff7c0aZerosense-Whisperwind|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61638:Player-55-0DF948C0:1:3:15:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Den of Nalorakk]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s4_2710\",\"timestamp\":1773594381},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nalorakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nalorakk says: Well done. Your strength rivals mine. The dream... ends.\",\"id\":\"s4_2711\",\"timestamp\":1773594381},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:3209|h[Loot]|h: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264332::::::::88:1480::17::1:28:3022:::::|h[Amani Ritual Altar]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_2712\",\"timestamp\":1773594385},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 26 Gold, 38 Silver, 41 Copper\",\"id\":\"s4_2713\",\"timestamp\":1773594387},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:3209|h[Loot]|h: You passed on: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264332::::::::88:1480::17::1:28:3022:::::|h[Amani Ritual Altar]|h|r |HlootHistory:3209|h|cnLOOT_LINK_COLOR:[View Loot Rolls]|r|h\",\"id\":\"s4_2714\",\"timestamp\":1773594392},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:3209|h[Loot]|h: Zerosense (Need - 35, Main-Spec) Won: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264332::::::::88:1480::17::1:28:3022:::::|h[Amani Ritual Altar]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s4_2715\",\"timestamp\":1773594392},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Zerosense-Whisperwind\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Zerosense-Whisperwind receives loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264332::::::::88:1480::17::1:28:3022:::::|h[Amani Ritual Altar]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_2716\",\"timestamp\":1773594392},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Jahex-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Jahex receives loot: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:251160::::::::88:1480::17:3:13441:13436:13578:2:9:83:28:3022:::::|h[Forest Dream Leg-guards]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_2717\",\"timestamp\":1773594393},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: The Den has been ravaged with vermin. If we deal with that problem the elders will be more favorable with us. Take a grymlinx--they are always up for a meal.\",\"id\":\"s4_2718\",\"timestamp\":1773594506},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Warglaives has increased to 445.\",\"id\":\"s4_2719\",\"timestamp\":1773594575},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Boletus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Boletus says: Go in Grudge Pit, Angryabsol.\",\"id\":\"s4_2720\",\"timestamp\":1773594575},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Boletus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Boletus says: Show fungarians what night elf can do. If strong.\",\"id\":\"s4_2721\",\"timestamp\":1773594577},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Discogoose-Thrall\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Discogoose-Thrall|h[|cff3fc7ebDiscogoose-Thrall|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61913:Player-3678-0B64334C:1:3:15:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[A Singular Problem]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s4_2722\",\"timestamp\":1773594577},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ranger Telenus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ranger Telenus says: Look at this mess!\",\"id\":\"s4_2723\",\"timestamp\":1773594647},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Angryabsol\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_RAID_BOSS_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_BOSS_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.8666667342185974,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"The guards' eyes are on you. Return to neutral territory.\",\"id\":\"s4_2724\",\"timestamp\":1773594662},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Angryabsol\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s4_2725\",\"timestamp\":1773594874},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: The Shadowguard's machinations continue in spite of our best efforts. Disrupt their operations.\",\"id\":\"s4_2726\",\"timestamp\":1773594879},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar begins making a campfire.\",\"id\":\"s4_2727\",\"timestamp\":1773594889},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Guard Captain Meti\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Guard Captain Meti yells: Don't let them interrupt Patram's work!\",\"id\":\"s4_2728\",\"timestamp\":1773594894},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_TEXT_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Valeera Sanguinar:755:TEXT_EMOTE:|hValeera Sanguinar|h points at you.\",\"id\":\"s4_2729\",\"timestamp\":1773594916},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar begins making a campfire.\",\"id\":\"s4_2730\",\"timestamp\":1773594920},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: The Shadowguard's machinations continue in spite of our best efforts. Disrupt their operations.\",\"timestamp\":1773594961,\"id\":\"s4_2731\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Angryabsol\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1773594972,\"id\":\"s4_2732\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: This area is compromised. It is vital to our mission that you secure it.\",\"timestamp\":1773594978,\"id\":\"s4_2733\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Here the very fabric of reality is chaotic and malformed. We could use your help studying the residue of such anomalies.\",\"timestamp\":1773594987,\"id\":\"s4_2734\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:258858::::::::89:1480:::1:13611:2:9:89:28:3322:::::|h[Threadbare Crown]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1773595035,\"id\":\"s4_2735\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:258138::::::::89:1480:::::::::|h[Potent Healing Potion]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1773595035,\"id\":\"s4_2736\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: The Terrace holds what we require to gain entry to the Voidstorm... the Cynosure of Twilight.\",\"timestamp\":1773595061,\"id\":\"s4_2737\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arcane Sentry\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Arcane Sentry yells: Unauthorized entry.\",\"timestamp\":1773595071,\"id\":\"s4_2738\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: You were warned, Umbric! The Terrace is forever closed to you! Now leave before--\",\"timestamp\":1773595131,\"id\":\"s4_2739\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Draenei\",\"name\":\"Ysbeer-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Ysbeer receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260662::::::::89:1480:::::::::|h[Polished Purple Pebble]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773595134,\"id\":\"s4_2740\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Draenei\",\"name\":\"Ysbeer-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Ysbeer receives loot: |cn