\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Muro'jin says: What does my eagle spy with her shiny eyes? A trespasser. An interloper! But ya won't take my prey from me!\",\"timestamp\":1773600599,\"id\":\"s4_3020\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Prisoner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Prisoner says: Dis favor won't be forgotten!\",\"timestamp\":1773600599,\"id\":\"s4_3021\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Prisoner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Prisoner says: I owe ya one, friend!\",\"timestamp\":1773600601,\"id\":\"s4_3022\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Officialclaw-Illidan\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Officialclaw-Illidan receives loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:251162::::::::90:1480::23:4:12779:13439:40:12701:1:28:3025:::::|h[Traitor's Talon]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773600736,\"id\":\"s4_3023\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 14 Gold, 83 Silver, 17 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1773600738,\"id\":\"s4_3024\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: A good kill, Angryabsol. And I rescued all that were still alive. But why did Muro'jin bring them here?\",\"timestamp\":1773600739,\"id\":\"s4_3025\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: De kidnapping won't stop until we get to de root of de evil. Follow me.\",\"timestamp\":1773600747,\"id\":\"s4_3026\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rokh'zal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Rokh'zal yells: You cannot stop de ritual! Spirits, rise!\",\"timestamp\":1773600759,\"id\":\"s4_3027\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: That... not be natural. And the energy flowing into it... This is hex magic.\",\"timestamp\":1773600761,\"id\":\"s4_3028\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: Using the souls of de dead in powerful magic spells... I hope this is not why they brought my kin here.\",\"timestamp\":1773600768,\"id\":\"s4_3029\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: It be worse than we thought. How many of my people have died here?\",\"timestamp\":1773600842,\"id\":\"s4_3030\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"name\":\"Meleona-Sargeras\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Meleona-Sargeras receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773600847,\"id\":\"s4_3031\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.6666666865348816,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Angryabsol|h[Angryabsol]: |h|A:ping_chat_threat:0:0:0:0|aThreatening alert: Grim Skirmisher\",\"timestamp\":1773600895,\"id\":\"s4_3032\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"name\":\"Meleona-Sargeras\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Meleona-Sargeras receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|rx2.\",\"timestamp\":1773600944,\"id\":\"s4_3033\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"name\":\"Meleona-Sargeras\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Meleona-Sargeras receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260651::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Lustrous Wildlife Pelt]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773600944,\"id\":\"s4_3034\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Rotog-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Rotog-Mal'Ganis receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773600945,\"id\":\"s4_3035\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Rotog-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":2},\"even