e\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Twilight's Blade be hidin' out at Speaker's Rest. Show them how a hash'ura protects Zul'Aman!\",\"id\":\"s4_3080\",\"timestamp\":1773601561},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Dariman-Thrall\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY\",\"type\":\"PARTY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party]|h |Hplayer:Dariman-Thrall:2418:PARTY:|h[|cfff48cbaDariman-Thrall|r]|h: den?\",\"id\":\"s4_3081\",\"timestamp\":1773601562},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY\",\"type\":\"PARTY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party]|h |Hplayer:Angryabsol-Stormrage:2419:PARTY:|h[|cffa330c9Angryabsol|r]|h: yo\",\"id\":\"s4_3082\",\"timestamp\":1773601564},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY\",\"type\":\"PARTY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party]|h |Hplayer:Angryabsol-Stormrage:2420:PARTY:|h[|cffa330c9Angryabsol|r]|h: ye\",\"id\":\"s4_3083\",\"timestamp\":1773601566},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Angryabsol\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s4_3084\",\"timestamp\":1773601575},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Do not worry about your friend, de would-be hash'ey. Nalorakk, de dreamer, de Loa of War, will test her strength.\",\"id\":\"s4_3085\",\"timestamp\":1773601593},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: A hash'ey is only as strong as their warriors. So, you too will be tested in Nalorakk's dream.\",\"id\":\"s4_3086\",\"timestamp\":1773601604},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: The loa dreams of de Amani's past. When de winter was their only foe. Preparin' for it will be your first trial.\",\"id\":\"s4_3087\",\"timestamp\":1773601614},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stickfigure-Whisperwind\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Stickfigure-Whisperwind receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|rx3.\",\"id\":\"s4_3088\",\"timestamp\":1773601726},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Dariman-Thrall\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Dariman-Thrall receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx2.\",\"id\":\"s4_3089\",\"timestamp\":1773601726},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Sto