an]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_3094\",\"timestamp\":1773601803},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Preparin' will help you in de trial ahead.\",\"id\":\"s4_3095\",\"timestamp\":1773601819},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Dariman-Thrall\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Dariman-Thrall receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:245573::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Salmon]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_3096\",\"timestamp\":1773601820},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Good. Resources will keep you alive.\",\"id\":\"s4_3097\",\"timestamp\":1773601848},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Harronir\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Meleona-Sargeras\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Meleona-Sargeras receives loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:245573::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Salmon]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_3098\",\"timestamp\":1773601849},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Salmon Pool\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Food offering gathered in preparation for the enduring winter.\",\"id\":\"s4_3099\",\"timestamp\":1773601849},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: In de winter there were those like de Hoardmonger whose greed burdened others.\",\"id\":\"s4_3100\",\"timestamp\":1773601857},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Dariman-Thrall\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Dariman-Thrall receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_3101\",\"timestamp\":1773601858},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: De Amani hash'ey used their most trusted warriors to eliminate them. For de good of de tribe.\",\"id\":\"s4_3102\",\"timestamp\":1773601864},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Well done. Like a living vine, some branches must be cut so de others may live. De tribe survives--for now.\",\"id\":\"s4_3103\",\"timestamp\":1773601971},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stickfigure-Whisperwind\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Stickfigure-Whisperwind receives loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:251146::::::::90:1480::23:5:12779:13439:6652:12699:13577:1:28:3025:::::|h[Scavenger's Spaulders]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s4_3104\",\"timestamp\":1773601972},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Blood