588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Leftclick-Zul'jin|h[|cff3fc7ebLeftclick-Zul'jin|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61730:Player-61-07914198:1:3:18:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Twilight Crypts Stories]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s5_4114\",\"timestamp\":1773854256},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Headteacher Doragosa\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Headteacher Doragosa yells: Welcome to Algeth'ar Academy! I am delighted that you received our invitation. The school is a touch behind schedule, but I have heard wondrous things about your capabilities. Perhaps you could help us?\",\"id\":\"s5_4115\",\"timestamp\":1773854338},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Black Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Black Dragonflight Recruiter says: Step right up and pledge the Black Dragonflight. We are a sure in for winning the Lish Llrath Championships! Go Darkwings!\",\"id\":\"s5_4116\",\"timestamp\":1773854355},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: New students! How wonderful. It has been quite some time since the Academy has been open.\",\"id\":\"s5_4117\",\"timestamp\":1773854408},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Red Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Red Dragonflight Recruiter says: Greetings! Have you considered pledging the Red Dragonflight? Anyone who is anyone will be. We are kind of a big deal.\",\"id\":\"s5_4118\",\"timestamp\":1773854411},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Ichistrasz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Ichistrasz says: Well, it seems like things are in further disrepair than we anticipated.\",\"id\":\"s5_4119\",\"timestamp\":1773854416},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Ichistrasz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Ichistrasz says: Indeed! Come with us! It should only take a moment to set up for a new lesson.\",\"id\":\"s5_4120\",\"timestamp\":1773854417},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: These lashers must have grown wild while we were away.\",\"id\":\"s5_4121\",\"timestamp\":1773854422},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: Please, if you could, clear them out while we realign the life magics of this place?\",\"id\":\"s5_4122\",\"timestamp\":1773854427},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: Perfect, we are just about--wait, Ichistrasz! There is too much life magic! What are you doing?\",\"id\":\"s5_4123\",\"timestamp\":1773854455},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Ichistrasz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Ichistrasz says: Me?! There is too much nature! What are you doing?\",\"id\":\"s5_4124\",\"timestamp\":1773854465},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: What is that thing? This is your fault!\",\"id\":\"s5_4125\",\"timestamp\":1773854469},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Ichistrasz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Ichistrasz says: Absolutely not!\",\"id\":\"s5_4126\",\"timestamp\":1773854473},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: Please help us, new students.\",\"id\":\"s5_4127\",\"timestamp\":1773854476},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Porass-Zul'jin\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Porass-Zul'jin|h[|cffc69b6dPorass-Zul'jin|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61892:Player-61-0EEE7908:1:3:18:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Shadow Enclave Discoveries]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s5_4128\",\"timestamp\":1773854495},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"e