\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Vereesa was the peacekeeper of our family. She spent many days tending to the gardens here, but the wilderness has overtaken it now.\",\"timestamp\":1773882470,\"id\":\"s5_4440\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: The soothing sounds of my harp brought Vereesa joy beyond measure. I'll need that relic.\",\"timestamp\":1773882558,\"id\":\"s5_4441\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"MagharOrc\",\"name\":\"Apocalypsese-Zul'jin\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Apocalypsese-Zul'jin|h[|cff0070ddApocalypsese-Zul'jin|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61211:Player-61-0ED4994D:1:3:18:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Welcome Home]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773882565,\"id\":\"s5_4442\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1773882598,\"id\":\"s5_4443\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 5 Gold, 85 Silver, 70 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1773882599,\"id\":\"s5_4444\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",