::|h[Unstable Arcane Essence]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773886670,\"id\":\"s5_4718\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Maxdormu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Maxdormu says: Please excuse the mess! It has been quite some time since students have been here. I am just putting together my lesson plan.\",\"timestamp\":1773886671,\"id\":\"s5_4719\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Unruly Textbook\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Unruly Textbook says: Chapter 6 Section 5: Idealism as Portrayed in the Dracthyr Renaissance...\",\"timestamp\":1773886686,\"id\":\"s5_4720\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Maxdormu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Maxdormu says: Ah! Here we are! Ahem--long ago, members of the blue dragonflight accidentally overloaded an arcane elemental and created a powerful construct named Vexamus that quickly started to wreak havoc!\",\"timestamp\":1773886702,\"id\":\"s5_4721\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Maxdormu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Maxdormu says: Though Vexamus tried its best to defeat the dragons, it was ultimately destroyed. Well done!\",\"timestamp\":1773886774,\"id\":\"s5_4722\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.666666686