 Doragosa\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Headteacher Doragosa yells: Welcome to Algeth'ar Academy! I am delighted that you received our invitation. The school is a touch behind schedule, but I have heard wondrous things about your capabilities. Perhaps you could help us?\",\"id\":\"s5_4847\",\"timestamp\":1773890443},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bronze Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Bronze Dragonflight Recruiter says: You look in a hurry, but if I could borrow you for a second to pledge the Bronze Dragonflight I promise your time will be well spent.\",\"id\":\"s5_4848\",\"timestamp\":1773890456},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Black Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Black Dragonflight Recruiter says: Step right up and pledge the Black Dragonflight. We are a sure in for winning the Lish Llrath Championships! Go Darkwings!\",\"id\":\"s5_4849\",\"timestamp\":1773890458},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Randomremix-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY_LEADER\",\"type\":\"PARTY_LEADER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.7843137979507446,\"r\":0.4627451300621033},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party Leader]|h |Hplayer:Randomremix-Mal'Ganis:2122:PARTY:|h[|cffa330c9Randomremix-Mal'Ganis|r]|h: welcome\",\"id\":\"s5_4850\",\"timestamp\":1773890536},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY\",\"type\"