be admired, but she never wanted to be worshipped.\",\"id\":\"s5_4875\",\"timestamp\":1773890975},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Randomremix-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY_LEADER\",\"type\":\"PARTY_LEADER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.7843137979507446,\"r\":0.4627451300621033},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party Leader]|h |Hplayer:Randomremix-Mal'Ganis:2197:PARTY:|h[|cffa330c9Randomremix-Mal'Ganis|r]|h: ouch!\",\"id\":\"s5_4876\",\"timestamp\":1773890976},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Randomremix-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY_LEADER\",\"type\":\"PARTY_LEADER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.7843137979507446,\"r\":0.4627451300621033},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party Leader]|h |Hplayer:Randomremix-Mal'Ganis:2198:PARTY:|h[|cffa330c9Randomremix-Mal'Ganis|r]|h: lol\",\"id\":\"s5_4877\",\"timestamp\":1773890976},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Angryabsol\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_TEXT_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You salute Darthryan-Ragnaros with respect.\",\"id\":\"s5_4878\",\"timestamp\":1773890978},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Come, let's find the next relic.\",\"id\":\"s5_4879\",\"timestamp\":1773890984},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Randomremix-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY_LEADER\",\"type\":\"PARTY_LEADER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.7843137979507446,\"r\":0.4627451300621033},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party Leader]|h |Hplayer:Randomremix-Mal'Ganis:2202:PARTY:|h[|cffa330c9Randomremix-Mal'Ganis|r]|h: frozen sec\",\"id\":\"s5_4880\",\"timestamp\":1773891001},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Vereesa was the peacekeeper of our family. She spent many days tending to the gardens here, but the wilderness has overtaken it now.\",\"id\":\"s5_4881\",\"timestamp\":1773891041},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Randomremix-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_YELL\",\"type\":\"YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Randomremix-Mal'Ganis:2205:YELL:|h[|cffa330c9Randomremix-Mal'Ganis|r]|h yells: HEE HEE!\",\"id\":\"s5_4882\",\"timestamp\":1773891047},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Randomremix-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_YELL\",\"type\":\"YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Randomremix-Mal'Ganis:2206:YELL:|h[|cffa330c9Randomremix-Mal'Ganis|r]|h yells: Darkness DOWN! \",\"id\":\"s5_4883\",\"timestamp\":1773891103},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Randomremix-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY_LEADER\",\"type\":\"PARTY_LEADER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.7843137979507446,\"r\":0.4627451300621033},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party Leader]|h |Hplayer:Randomremix-Mal'Ganis:2207:PARTY:|h[|cffa330c9Randomremix-Mal'Ganis|r]|h: oops\",\"id\":\"s5_4884\",\"timestamp\":1773891135},{