ing to the task... including her life.\",\"timestamp\":1774025386,\"id\":\"s6_3703\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Gold, 20 Silver, 89 Copper\",\"timestamp\":1774025562,\"id\":\"s6_3704\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Guard\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Guard says: Your toying with the fel will be the end of you one day, night elf.\",\"id\":\"s6_3705\",\"timestamp\":1774026785},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"name\":\"Kojapa-Kel'Thuzad\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kojapa-Kel'Thuzad|h[|cff33937fKojapa-Kel'Thuzad|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62159:Player-3693-0E27FB8A:1:3:20:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Prey: Bloody Green Thumbs (Hard)]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1774026887,\"id\":\"s6_3706\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"name\":\"Kojapa-Kel'Thuzad\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kojapa-Kel'Thuzad|h[|cff33937fKojapa-Kel'Thuzad|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62161:Player-3693-0E27FB8A:1:3:20:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Prey: Outsmarting the Schemers (Hard)]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1774027544,\"id\":\"s6_3707\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Chailatté-